# Atelloune's Lament (sandoria 114): Atelloune in Southern San d'Oria (no NPC script; default 884; no other quest or
# mission names her). The offer wants fame level 2 and the Crystal War quest Seeing Spots completed. Fame 50 without
# Seeing Spots: no section, 884; Seeing Spots accepted (GM: not completed, the status test is `== COMPLETED`): 884;
# Seeing Spots completed (GM) at fame 49: 884; at fame 50: a trade (no trade handler while available: nothing), 890
# (option 1: begun; any option begins it, #inventory_full takes option 0). Accepted: 892; a chip (not the wing: nil), a
# wing and a chip, two wings (not exactly one: nil, nothing); one wing: 891 (completed: Trainee Gloves, fame +20; the
# wing taken). Completed: no section, 884.
lists SouthernSanDoria/Atelloune/onTrigger SouthernSanDoria/Atelloune/onTrade SouthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/890 SouthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/891
char zone=SouthernSanDoria pos=124.9,0.0,84.7 job=WAR lvl=30
fame Sandoria 50
item LadybugWing x3
item BoneChip
login
trigger Atelloune                         # fame level 2, Seeing Spots not begun: no section; 884
finish
quest CrystalWar.SeeingSpots accepted
trigger Atelloune                         # fame level 2, Seeing Spots accepted (not completed): no section; 884
finish
quest CrystalWar.SeeingSpots completed
fame Sandoria 49
trigger Atelloune                         # Seeing Spots completed, fame level 1: no section; 884
finish
fame Sandoria 50
trade Atelloune BoneChip x1               # available, offered: no trade handler; no script: nothing
trigger Atelloune                         # fame level 2, Seeing Spots completed: 890
finish option=1                           # begun (any option)
trigger Atelloune                         # accepted: 892
finish
trade Atelloune BoneChip x1               # not the wing: nil; nothing
trade Atelloune LadybugWing x1 BoneChip x1   # not exactly the wing: nil; nothing
trade Atelloune LadybugWing x2            # two wings: nil; nothing
trade Atelloune LadybugWing x1            # exactly the wing: 891
finish                                    # completed: Trainee Gloves, fame +20; the wing taken
trigger Atelloune                         # completed: no section; 884
finish
